  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_lamb_cbeb9d4307d2f31a7b1fd87031bb61f5acf959c0b60fbdd4a4cbb2e54b427e0386">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>lambfell / lambskin: the skin or fleece of a lamb, used as fur; traded white or black, tawed (dressed) or undressed, and from Ireland, Spain, Britain etc. (the skin of a lamb that died by disease or accident is a morkin).</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
  </rdf:Description>
